<v Boy>来自PRI，国际公共广播电台——

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:04.590
<v Woman>From PRI, Public Radio--
<v Woman>来自PRI，公共广播——

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:05.640
<v Man>From PRI--
<v Man>来自PRI——

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:06.380
<v Boy>Public Radio International--
<v Boy>国际公共广播电台——

